  "summary": "Set the day/night state with MSV.13 NightSetBackMode, the user mode with MSV.3 and write the day setpoint AV.7. Read AV.1 ControlTemp, MSV.9 NightSetBack and the heating/cooling demands AV.2/AV.3.",
